x. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1549600/extras/fbd6a9663c4f4ac4108dbe4829bffdaa.poster.avif?t=1741167109\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1549600/extras/fbd6a9663c4f4ac4108dbe4829bffdaa.webm?t=1741167109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1549600/extras/fbd6a9663c4f4ac4108dbe4829bffdaa.mp4?t=1741167109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Scientists, Workers and Operators will populate your Utopia, and their well-being is key to the prosperity of your city. Fulfill their needs and get access to advanced technology and building schematics. Create your own technocratic paradise!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1549600/extras/e0cc9647151dfab1cc25605b4a2d4d60.poster.avif?t=1741167109\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1549600/extras/e0cc9647151dfab1cc25605b4a2d4d60.webm?t=1741167109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1549600/extras/e0cc9647151dfab1cc25605b4a2d4d60.mp4?t=1741167109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Set up supply chains, and grow and optimize them to ensure the steady growth of your city. Start by mining rock and coal and progress to developing experimental composite materials. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1549600/extras/bf86345eb50690d919b1bc82cb036493.poster.avif?t=1741167109\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1549600/extras/bf86345eb50